WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:02,370
Gao Construction's tasks were overfulfilled

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:06,370
Wisdom and patience are more important than brute force in the mountains and forests

3
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:16,350
A century of wild gnosis is worth its weight in gold

4
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:26,880
Wild iron stone pot is of good vintage and worth the risk

5
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:36,040
Spatial connections are enhanced

6
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:40,040
The life energy of the iron stone teapot resonates with the space

7
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:41,040
The space has been upgraded

8
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:54,310
The ability to control objects can save a lot of manpower when building a house.

9
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:57,310
Now I can do most of it by myself

10
00:00:57,310 --> 00:00:59,310
Go back first and try your abilities
